      "featured_image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0631/0251/7500/files/C-SQUARE-bookshelf_gallery_01.jpg?v=1753366965",
      "description_html": "<div class=\"view-mode-full clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\">\n<p>Modular bookshelf in aluminium with dynamic led lighting. Modular elements composed of square aluminium cells and vertical support panels. All components are made of 10mm thick aluminium panels, with the vertical supports and cells featuring integrated LED bars within their thickness. Each led bar can be controlled individually to create customised lighting scenarios via a DMX (Digital Multiplex) system, with optional integration into a home automation network upon request. Optional adjustable magnetic dividers for the cells are available in aluminium, upholstered in leather or fabric, or veneered in open-pore wood finishes. The system also includes modules with bronze or smoked glass doors and drawer units. The entire structure is coated in a satin gunmetal ribbed finish. The vertical supports and cells are designed for full tool-less plug &amp; play assembly, allowing installation and maintenance without tools. All light sources are equipped with magnetic clips, making them easily detachable and replaceable. The production process is based on high-precision aluminium machining, using 100% recyclable materials with a highly sustainable approach, avoiding the use of wood. Drivers and control modules are housed in the base or top section. Available as a freestanding room divider or wall-mounted unit, with an indicative maximum power consumption of 200W per linear metre.</p>\n</div>"
